(My Contribution) Tj
0 -18 Td
0 -18 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(In this project, I mainly worked on the sales timing and trends analysis. My part was to understand when the business was generating more revenue by comparing the weekday and monthly patterns. I focused on identifying the strongest and weakest sales days and months, including the performance of Electronics. One finding that stood out to me was that Saturday had the highest average daily revenue, while Tuesday was the lowest. January was the strongest month, while June was the weakest, and Electronics also showed a noticeable decline during this period. I used these findings to provide useful timing signals for the team's analysis and recommendations.) Tj
0 -18 Td
