(What I Learned from My Teammates) Tj
0 -18 Td
0 -18 Td
/F1 11 Tf
(I learned something useful from each of my teammates while working on this project. From Akash, I understood that cleaning and validating the data is very important before starting any analysis. From Ashika, I learned how product-level analysis can provide more detail than simply looking at overall sales patterns. From Pavithra, I learned how different findings can be connected to form clear business insights and recommendations. Working together also helped me understand why observed sales patterns should be treated as useful signals rather than direct proof of causation.) Tj
